note """analysis check: a var read while nothing anywhere writes it. That is not a zero-value read, it is a value nothing ever produces. The distinction from the sibling fixture is the whole content of the rule."""
flow orders
import "github.com/acme/billing"
import "acme.dev/flows/audit"
var attempt int
source ingest Poll
transform charge billing.Charge from ingest
  reads attempt
sink done audit.Store from charge
